cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code in published work, please cite the underlying
  physics references (Bosch & Hale 1992 for D-T reactivity, NRL
  Plasma Formulary for bremsstrahlung, Fischer 2020 for TBR,
  Entler 2018 for DEMO cost). v0.7.0 (2026-08-30) is the third
  feature release: PROCESS + OpenMC + Paramak real upstream
  integration, Monte Carlo uncertainty quantification, cross-
  sections management. Tier 1-7 in full. 609 tests.
title: "z-pinch-postproc"
